.git
.gitignore
*.md
**/*_test.go
# The system prompts are //go:embed-ed, so they must reach the build context.
# `*.md` does not cross `/` and never excluded them, but be explicit about it.
!internal/systemprompts/defaults/*.md
!internal/skills/defaults/*.md
# Same reason: nib's own documentation is embedded and served to the agent.
!internal/nibdocs/docs/*.md

# Locally compiled binaries — the image builds its own in the build stage.
/nib
/toolcatalog
